        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9301, Notched Edge cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA simple classic, this cabinet knob made by RK International has a notched edge that grants it a subtle point of interest. Perfect for traditional homes, the Notched Cabinet Knob is available in a 1-1/4 inch size as well as a 1-1/2 inch size. Choose from the 5 finishes for a look that speaks of your personal style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9301 Truncated Edge Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-9301:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-9302:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
